#: bell.cpp:73
msgid "Bell Settings"
msgstr "Zil Caylaw"

#: bell.cpp:82
msgid "&Use system bell instead of system notification"
msgstr "Sistem belderüläre urınına sistem zilen &qullanası"

#: bell.cpp:83
msgid ""
"You can use the standard system bell (PC speaker) or a more sophisticated "
"system notification, see the \"System Notifications\" control module for the "
"\"Something Special Happened in the Program\" event."
msgstr ""
"Sistemneñ töp zile (PC söylätkeçe) urınına köyläwle belderülär dä qullanıp "
"bula, bonı öçen \"Sistem Belderüläre\" digän caylaw bülegenä kerep, "
"yazılımnarda eşläw çağılışın köyläp bula."

#: bell.cpp:91
msgid ""
"<h1>System Bell</h1> Here you can customize the sound of the standard system "
"bell, i.e. the \"beep\" you always hear when there is something wrong. Note "
"that you can further customize this sound using the \"Accessibility\" control "
"module; for example, you can choose a sound file to be played instead of the "
"standard bell."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Sistem Zile</h1> Sistemneñ töp zil tawışın bonda köyläp bula, berär närsä "
"yalğış eşlägändä yañğırawçı tawış ul. Anıñ östämä caylawın \"Qulaylıq\" digän "
"idärä modulında tabıp bula, ü.ö. şul töp zil urınına berär tawış biremen "
"uynattırırğa bula."

#: bell.cpp:97
msgid "&Volume:"
msgstr "&Köç:"

#: bell.cpp:102
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the volume of the system bell. For further customization "
"of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"Sistem zileneñ köçen bonda köyläp bula. Östämä köyläwlär \"Qulaylıq\" digän "
"modul eçendä tabıp bula."

#: bell.cpp:106
msgid "&Pitch:"
msgstr "&Adım:"

#: bell.cpp:108
msgid " Hz"
msgstr " Hz"

#: bell.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the pitch of the system bell. For further customization "
"of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"Sistem zileneñ qalınlığı bonda köyläp bula. Östämä köyläwlär \"Qulaylıq\" digän "
"modul eçendä tabıp bula."

#: bell.cpp:115
msgid "&Duration:"
msgstr "&Eş arası:"

#: bell.cpp:117
msgid " msec"
msgstr " msek"

#: bell.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"Sistem zile yañğırağan ozınlığın bonda köyläp bula. Östämä köyläwlär "
"\"Qulaylıq\" digän modul eçendä tabıp bula."

#: bell.cpp:124
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Sınaw"

#: bell.cpp:128
msgid ""
"Click \"Test\" to hear how the system bell will sound using your changed "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"\"Sınaw\" östenä çirtep, tawış caylawına kertkän üzgäreşlär çağılışın tıñlap "
"bula."

